{
  "slug": "atlan",
  "name": "Atlan",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Atlan data catalog plugin for Claude Code. Search, explore, govern, and manage your data assets through natural language. Powered by the Atlan MCP server with semantic search, lineage traversal, glossary management, data quality rules, and more.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `atlan`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install atlan@claude-plugins-official` from `atlanhq/agent-toolkit`.\n\nThis repository contains a collection of tools and protocols for interacting with Atlan services for AI agents. Each component is designed to provide specific functionality and can be used independently or together.",
